  "worked_solution": "The graph above shows the function in the interval $-1\\le x\\le 2.$\n\nSince this interval has length $3,$ and the period of the function is also $3,$ this interval represents a single period of the function.\n\nTherefore, the function will consist of many copies of the shape shown above, shifted horizontally by multiples of $3.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14249580/assets/71356315a5669dbd5d3a794a046e0c647f674905f89099f8c74d521f10b7498c.png)",
